{"title":"DOGE is getting a new owner","link":"https://www.garbageday.email/p/doge-is-getting-a-new-owner","date":1747419992000,"content":"<div><div><p><i>Welcome to Garbage Weekend. It’s the internet garbage you know and love, but in a format that’s easier to read while you think about </i>Andor <i>and how lucky we are that it exists.</i></p><div><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/1527976b-469f-472d-a1ef-9adc7ede81bd/Screenshot_2025-05-16_at_11.50.03_AM.png?t=1747410623\" /><div><span><p>(<a href=\"https://x.com/Mike_Wagenheim/status/1922186027290022072/video/1?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=doge-is-getting-a-new-owner\" target=\"_blank\">x.com/Mike_Wagenheim</a>)</p></span></div></div><p>This week, we learned that Elon Musk <a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/politics/policy/doge-russ-vought-trump-elon-musk-0a1bbeb4?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=doge-is-getting-a-new-owner\" target=\"_blank\">plans to hand control</a> of the Department of Government Efficiency (DOGE) over to the director of the Office of Management and Budget (OPM), Russell Vought, who already runs DOGE's parent agency. He'll oversee projects like <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/05/13/us/politics/doge-musk-contracts-trump.html?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=doge-is-getting-a-new-owner\" target=\"_blank\">quietly reinstating dozens of programs</a> they tried to cut, handling <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/05/14/us/politics/doge-watchdog-case-appeals-ruling.html?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=doge-is-getting-a-new-owner\" target=\"_blank\">ongoing legal cases against the office</a>, and generally holding the bag for Musk. Just like the rest of us. Maybe he can ask Grok for help, as long as it doesn’t <a href=\"https://www.404media.co/why-did-grok-start-talking-about-white-genocide/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=doge-is-getting-a-new-owner\" target=\"_blank\">randomly switch to racist conspiracies</a> about South Africa. It all happens on X! At least we still have Instagram, unless you're James Comey and may be facing <a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c70nqk9rlxpo?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=doge-is-getting-a-new-owner\" target=\"_blank\">criminal charges for posting</a> there. It’s thankfully still legal to post about President Trump’s <a href=\"https://www.snopes.com/fact-check/trump-saudi-mobile-mcdonalds/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=doge-is-getting-a-new-owner\" target=\"_blank\">mobile McDonald’s</a>. Now this is the kind of government efficiency worth trading <a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/world/us/faa-hit-by-new-90-second-communications-outage-newark-air-traffic-2025-05-09/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=doge-is-getting-a-new-owner\" target=\"_blank\">plane travel</a> and <a href=\"https://www.scientificamerican.com/article/how-trumps-national-weather-service-cuts-could-cost-lives/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=doge-is-getting-a-new-owner\" target=\"_blank\">knowing the weather </a>for!</p><p>Oh well, here’s some fun stuff…</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/megannn_lynne/status/1923100163670761913?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=doge-is-getting-a-new-owner\" target=\"_blank\">Good post about brushing your teeth</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/oogooboggins/status/1922877907338252701?s=12&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=doge-is-getting-a-new-owner\" target=\"_blank\">A powerful cartoon</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@luna_bunn_ttv/video/7501498295806741791?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=doge-is-getting-a-new-owner\" target=\"_blank\">Old survival horror games be like</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/ledbydonkeys.org/post/3loltwljm2k2t?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=doge-is-getting-a-new-owner\" target=\"_blank\">WW2 veteran crushes a Tesla with a tank</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/anxeious/783195856344121344?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=doge-is-getting-a-new-owner\" target=\"_blank\">An uplifting meme</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/segamascott/783611958688677888?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=doge-is-getting-a-new-owner\" target=\"_blank\">Still time to get this guy’s “man made coffee”</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/midsmoker34/status/1923180091250466889?s=12&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=doge-is-getting-a-new-owner\" target=\"_blank\">A good post about giving up</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/berry_gatherer/status/1923216398941139078?s=12&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=doge-is-getting-a-new-owner\" target=\"_blank\">White people when there’s coleslaw</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AnbEBT1xUgg&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=doge-is-getting-a-new-owner\" target=\"_blank\">A beautiful Blink-182 cover</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/gahhnie/status/1922117224401158148?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=doge-is-getting-a-new-owner\" target=\"_blank\">Flushmogged</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/jacobdoesstuff.bsky.social/post/3lovwmvu2gs2b?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=ne